cinnamon-clipboard (1.3.4~beta4) noble; urgency=medium

  Added:
  * Ignored applications: copies made in listed applications (password
    managers by default) are never recorded.
  * Pause button in the quick menu to stop and resume history recording.
  * The welcome wizard asks whether to check for updates at startup.

  Fixed:
  * Always overwrite deleted history items in the database file.
  * Make old saved images and the configuration folder private to the user.
  * Never change permissions through a symbolic link.
  * Pin actions/checkout in the release workflow and drop the stored token.

 -- Akos Keresztes <akos.keresztes@gmail.com>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 21:31:41 +0100

